### 1. ROOT CAUSE DIAGNOSIS

The crash "TypeError: Cannot convert a Symbol value to a string" occurs when:
- RootLayout wraps Stack.Screen elements in a Fragment (<>)
- expo-router's <Stack> component calls React.Children.toArray() on its children
- toArray does NOT flatten Fragments; each Fragment remains in the array
- The "Unknown child element" warning tries to interpolate child.type (a Symbol for Fragment) into a string
- Error location: bundle.js around line 1108:1499 (varies by build)

