### 3. THE FIX

File: mobile/src/app/_layout.tsx

Changed from:
```jsx
<Stack>
  <>
    {hasToken && <Stack.Screen name="chat" ... />}
    {hasToken && <Stack.Screen name="settings" ... />}
    {!hasToken && <Stack.Screen name="setup" ... />}
  </>
</Stack>
```

Changed to:
```jsx
<Stack>
  {hasToken && <Stack.Screen name="chat" ... />}
  {hasToken && <Stack.Screen name="settings" ... />}
  {!hasToken && <Stack.Screen name="setup" ... />}
</Stack>
```

The fix removes the Fragment wrapper. Stack.Screen elements are now direct children of <Stack>.
Conditional rendering is safe because React.Children.toArray() drops `false` children.
This avoids the Symbol-to-string conversion that triggers the error.

